   =========================================================
   WHY border-bottom IS USED INSTEAD OF text-decoration

   text-decoration: underline;
   • Underline is part of the text itself
   • Position, thickness, and spacing cannot be controlled
   • Underline sits too close to text
   • Affects descenders (g, y, p, j)

   border-bottom:
   • Gives full control over thickness, color, and spacing
   • Can be placed away from the text using padding
   • Looks consistent across fonts
   • Easy to animate on hover
   • Commonly used in navbars and links

   COMPARISON:

   text-decoration: underline;
   → Simple underline, limited styling

   border-bottom: 2px solid black;
   → Custom underline with better control

   COMMON USE CASES:
   • Navigation menus
   • Active link indicators
   • Hover effects
   • Modern UI designs

